WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Chicken adobo: a step-by-step guide.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Ingredients: chicken, soy sauce, vinegar, garlic, bay leaves, peppercorns and water.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Step one: marinate the chicken in soy sauce and garlic for 30 minutes.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Step two: brown the chicken, about 3 minutes per side.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Step three: add the marinade, vinegar, water, bay leaves and peppercorns, then simmer covered for 30 minutes.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Step four: simmer uncovered until the sauce thickens.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Serve with hot steamed rice.

